39
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:59,180
From the flooded eyes to skies of blue,

40
00:01:59,180 --> 00:02:01,880
There's a brighter chapter waiting just for you.

41
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:04,460
Next door, the garden centre wears a friendly face,

42
00:02:04,460 --> 00:02:07,180
But Fake Grandad makes you feel unsafe in that place.

43
00:02:07,180 --> 00:02:10,000
You know where his eyes go, and it makes you mad,

44
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,860
Makes you sad, makes your whole body feel bad.

45
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:15,280
Jess, it isn't yours to carry, none of that shame,

46
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:17,980
Tell Bonny, tell a teacher, put a boundary on his name.

47
00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:20,820
Stay with people who believe you, keep the door in sight,

48
00:02:20,820 --> 00:02:23,420
You deserve to feel protected every day and night.

49
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:26,140
And the money in the family has a history of pain,

50
00:02:26,140 --> 00:02:28,860
David helped to build it through the sun and through the rain.

51
00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:31,400
Worked like somebody's servant, gave his whole life away,

52
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:33,880
Then got tossed aside and told, 'You're not my real son today.'

53
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:36,620
But blood can't buy a brother, and a name can't make a home,

54
00:02:36,620 --> 00:02:39,340
David knows the road you're on, so you don't walk alone.

55
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:42,000
After years of flooding tears, two beers and honest talk,

56
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,780
A little light came through the cracks, a little room to walk.

57
00:02:44,780 --> 00:02:47,820
No more keeping quiet just to keep the peace,

58
00:02:47,820 --> 00:02:50,500
No more making smaller what you feel and need.

59
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:53,340
If the dark comes knocking, let the good ones know,

60
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:56,300
You are not alone here, and you're not a ghost.

61
00:02:56,300 --> 00:02:58,780
Jess, you're not the wreckage, you're the road beyond,

62
